Monocypher 4.0.3, vendored for the gPlatform layer (--enable-platform): Ed25519 (SHA-512)
verification of platform login tokens (src/tron/gPlatformToken.cpp, crypto_ed25519_check).

Official release files, unmodified, from
https://monocypher.org/download/monocypher-4.0.3.tar.gz
(sha256 8cc9bc341a66249016db9bd70e9142d8d0aef9945973744b1ac05dbc55d8ee66):
src/monocypher.c/.h, src/optional/monocypher-ed25519.c/.h and LICENCE.md.
Dual licensed BSD-2-Clause or CC0. Compiled as C into libtron.a only with --enable-platform
(end of src/Makefile.am). To update, replace those five files with a newer official 4.x
release; do not edit them.
